mat%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ae4bebb2e181b8b18d01e622e9dd5592, https://si.imgix.net/5d7f13ea/uploads/origins/31b3b07b-11b1-4c17-9c10-89b0958b9bee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d3d1e73d8ac2643b4e0b25f91ca461dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5d7f13ea/uploads/origins/31b3b07b-11b1-4c17-9c10-89b0958b9bee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3570cab8adf97e669c7be3fb1eb11c95 3x"}, "body": "【依頼内容】\n作品を見ていただき、イラストを描いていただきたいです。\n\n囚人さんの映画のワンシーンのようなイラストがいつも大好きで、あと囚人さんの描かれる青年が大好きなのでエドワードが居ると嬉しいです…🥲💖\n場面に指定なく、シリアスでも平和でも何でも大丈夫です…！服装もド現代な服装さえ避けていただければ何でも大丈夫です……！\n(*ちなみにユリシスの場合自分の意思で女性的な服装をすることは無く、華やかな服装は男爵の趣味です)\n\n使用用途：個人鑑賞、自分用限定でグッズ印刷、部屋やスマホ壁紙に飾る、その他希望用途が発生した場合は都度相談\n\n\n希望フォーマット：A4またはB5  CMYK 350dpi PSD (サイン別レイヤー)\n\n\n\n本当にお忙しい中ありがとうございます😭💖💖\n囚人さんのイラストがずっと大好きで、一次創作を始めてからというもの「いつか囚人さんのイラストで私の創作を拝みたいな……」とずっっと考えていたので、本当に機会をいただけてひたすら全力で感謝しております😭💖\n\nご無理のない範囲でゆっくり制作していただけたらと存じます…！\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします🤍\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-UbCZbUh3gE_UnpLDZ_nNq_lQguwIJiY", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ood_do0/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2029994, "client_id": 1151818, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/83cd13f5/uploads/origins/201dbe2e-0aa1-4533-893b-0845f8367d54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=304f9616ed4caa0b6a855c4a3a8d67bb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/83cd13f5/uploads/origins/201dbe2e-0aa1-4533-893b-0845f8367d54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=304f9616ed4caa0b6a855c4a3a8d67bb, https://si.imgix.net/83cd13f5/uploads/origins/201dbe2e-0aa1-4533-893b-0845f8367d54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d0eb4afdb31a0e56ca521433ecaaeef 2x, https://si.imgix.net/83cd13f5/uploads/origins/201dbe2e-0aa1-4533-893b-0845f8367d54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=659577efbb654aadd9c678f2fbf504f4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/83cd13f5/uploads/origins/201dbe2e-0aa1-4533-893b-0845f8367d54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ded21c797020929d2f8c2ee7f0b8cec", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/83cd13f5/uploads/origins/201dbe2e-0aa1-4533-893b-0845f8367d54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ded21c797020929d2f8c2ee7f0b8cec, https://si.imgix.net/83cd13f5/uploads/origins/201dbe2e-0aa1-4533-893b-0845f8367d54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b4573616fe148046894e9ca358bf75ed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/83cd13f5/uploads/origins/201dbe2e-0aa1-4533-893b-0845f8367d54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=34e33f7e63c644bf968feada683e4dc3 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, please excuse the request.\n\nI would like to ask you to draw either Ali Baba or Morgiana (beanstalk) from Grimnotes, whichever is easier to draw...!\n\nThey are a desert merchant and his followers.\nAli Baba is a cheerful person and a nice young man who is loved by everyone.\nMorgiana is a beautiful and talented woman who is blindly devoted to Ali Baba.\n\nI hope you find this illustration helpful.\n\n\nI'm always rooting for you! I really, really love it 🥲.\nIf you don't mind, I would like to include it in my personal book for viewing. 💦\nI would really, really appreciate it if you could deliver it to me in A5 PSD if you don't mind...! 😭 I love your illustrations!!! 🥲💖", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 285802, "creator": true,